    // in languages/lib/js-rt.metajs (jpNew ... js_jsdrain). The three engines run the
    // SAME algorithm over the same value model: a promise is a plain object carrying
    // hidden slots only, so it needs no new value kind, no typeof arm and no own keys.
    //
    //      __prom  true            marks the object
    //      __ps    0 | 1 | 2       pending / fulfilled / rejected
    //      __pv    any             the settled value or the rejection reason
    //      __pcb   array           reactions registered while still pending
