    // body without answering the pending next(), a yield answers it and parks.
    //
    // The twins are jpAg* in languages/lib/js-rt.metajs and agReq/agPump/agStep in
    // abnf/jsrtjsprint.go.
    //
    // ag.throw(e) RAISES AT THE SUSPENDED YIELD, and it needs no throw-in channel in
